{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The legendary Czech freeware game from 1993 returns!</strong><br>Control a locomotive, collect cargo, and watch your train grow longer with every item you pick up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D classic, you gather items, avoid crashing into your own wagons and walls, and try to complete each level. Once everything is collected, simply pass through the gate to advance to the next stage. Each level has its own password, allowing you to return to it anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game now features two modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong> \u2013 the original game in its unchanged form<br><strong>Extended Mode \u2013 a new version with new and special levels</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the nostalgia or discover a brand new challenge!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4122730?t=1770921656","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4122730?t=1770921656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122730/ef7d80b5664a9262100e3e325c8534189530af57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770921656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122730/ef7d80b5664a9262100e3e325c8534189530af57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770921656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The legendary Czech freeware game from 1993 returns!</strong><br>Control a locomotive, collect cargo, and watch your train grow longer with every item you pick up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D classic, you gather items, avoid crashing into your own wagons and walls, and try to complete each level. Once everything is collected, simply pass through the gate to advance to the next stage. Each level has its own password, allowing you to return to it anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game now features two modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong> \u2013 the original game in its unchanged form<br><strong>Extended Mode \u2013 a new version with new and special levels</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the nostalgia or discover a brand new challenge!</p>","developers":["Ji\u0159\u00ed K\u0159ek"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122730/936d9d22f1288dfc923fce12348d3fbca51a6bb4/header.jpg?t=1770921656","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 / SteamOS or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 1.6 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any 64-bit Intel or Apple Silicon CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4122730/1031344614/5dd7813c5bc9b28a024a57226fc45340a548a1eb/1761497985/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762894254","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4122730/1031344614/5dd7813c5bc9b28a024a57226fc45340a548a1eb/1761497985/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762894254","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4122730/1031344614/5dd7813c5bc9b28a024a57226fc